{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronger Together</strong>  <br>The bond mechanic in Linkies is a fresh twist on co-op platformers. It\u2019s not a racing game, but a true test of your relationship with your friends.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/24ac2ef7897cf85d6b06879b35deee64.poster.avif?t=1774875982\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/24ac2ef7897cf85d6b06879b35deee64.webm?t=1774875982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/24ac2ef7897cf85d6b06879b35deee64.mp4?t=1774875982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Parkour Levels</strong> <br>Embark on a journey to the edge of outer space with every jump! Don\u2019t be fooled by the game\u2019s simple controls; you must work in harmony with your Linky. Panic, and you risk falling!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d706065d1d29b904743c9442782a1b6e.poster.avif?t=1774875982\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d706065d1d29b904743c9442782a1b6e.webm?t=1774875982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d706065d1d29b904743c9442782a1b6e.mp4?t=1774875982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make new friends in Linkies, chat with them, and enjoy the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/32164f7f18ce7324ef4471e246c6f649.poster.avif?t=1774875982\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/32164f7f18ce7324ef4471e246c6f649.webm?t=1774875982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/32164f7f18ce7324ef4471e246c6f649.mp4?t=1774875982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Underestimate Linkies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linkies can turn even massive planets into dust with lasers they shoot from their heads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d0ab2c909ce0019d4f47445df1513f63.poster.avif?t=1774875982\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d0ab2c909ce0019d4f47445df1513f63.webm?t=1774875982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/extras/d0ab2c909ce0019d4f47445df1513f63.mp4?t=1774875982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Course is a Different Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the depths of space through challenging parkour courses and travel to unexplored lands!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063950?t=1774875982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/a7a92d15381842f6274ed99f92d1995dfffa96ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774875982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063950/165317a45f1198e1d75530ee65